1
00:01:38,483 --> 00:01:41,274
埃隆伍德要实施戒严并抛弃曼特城!
Ironwood's declaring martial law and abandoning Mantle!

2
00:01:41,566 --> 00:01:44,316
Salem要来了所以他要用权杖去移动擎天
Salem is coming and he's going to use the Staff to move Atlas.

3
00:01:44,358 --> 00:01:47,024
如果我们不阻止他 曼特城就要
If we don't stop him Mantle's going to be--

4
00:01:47,274 --> 00:01:49,316
实施戒严?
Declaring martial law?

5
00:01:49,858 --> 00:01:51,566
我们不能让他这么做
We cannot let him do this.

6
00:01:51,608 --> 00:01:55,816
Hill小姐 我想将军一定明白他自己决定的重
Ms. Hill, I'm sure the General understands the enormity of his-

7
00:02:03,941 --> 00:02:04,858
克洛弗
Clover...

8
00:02:08,149 --> 00:02:08,774
克罗
Qrow,

9
00:02:09,358 --> 00:02:11,691
你需要知道我奉命将你带回
you should know that I've been asked to bring you in.

10
00:02:13,941 --> 00:02:15,899
免费坐车还有戏看!
A free ride and a show!

11
00:02:16,108 --> 00:02:18,899
并且也下达了捉捕RWBY小队的警示
There's also an alert out for Team RWBY's arrest.

12
00:02:19,066 --> 00:02:19,566
什么?
What?

13
00:02:20,316 --> 00:02:22,108
詹姆斯是疯了吗?
Has James lost his mind?

14
00:02:22,149 --> 00:02:26,316
他要解决任何试图阻止这个残忍计划的人
He's trying to stop anybody who might get in the way of this inhumane plan.

15
00:02:26,649 --> 00:02:28,483
看来他是小看我了
Looks like he underestimated me.

16
00:02:29,108 --> 00:02:29,691
我再说一次
Again.

17
00:02:29,733 --> 00:02:31,566
只有克罗会被捕
Only Qrow is under arrest.

18
00:02:31,774 --> 00:02:35,316
在经历了今晚的事情后 请不要让我把你也抓起来
After everything we've been through tonight please don't make me arrest you too.

19
00:02:37,191 --> 00:02:39,024
你们两个都够了!
Cut it out! Both of you.

20
00:02:39,399 --> 00:02:41,316
我们马上就要回到擎天了
We're almost back to Atlas.

21
00:02:41,608 --> 00:02:43,233
我们可以去跟詹姆斯好好谈谈然后
Let's talk to James personally and--

22
00:02:43,274 --> 00:02:46,774
这个节目的高潮部分怎么还没到啊
It's taking a very long time for this show to get to the good part.

23
00:02:46,816 --> 00:02:47,858
闭嘴!
Shut up!

24
00:02:47,899 --> 00:02:48,691
他是对的
He's right.

25
00:02:49,108 --> 00:02:50,441
来结束这一切吧
Let's get this over with.

26
00:02:50,483 --> 00:02:50,983
罗宾!
Robyn!

27
00:02:54,733 --> 00:02:55,316
行吧
Fine.

28
00:02:58,358 --> 00:03:00,191
我希望事情不用闹成这样
I wish it hadn't come to this.

29
00:03:00,233 --> 00:03:01,524
本来就不用的!
It doesn't have to!

30
00:03:02,941 --> 00:03:05,149
你们可以等我们击败他后再握手言和!
You can hug it out once we've taken him down!

31
00:03:16,191 --> 00:03:17,316
你在做什么?
What are you doing?

32
00:03:17,566 --> 00:03:21,274
如我们的女神所愿!
The will of our goddess!

33
00:03:29,816 --> 00:03:30,733
Weiss
Weiss.

34
00:03:30,899 --> 00:03:32,274
你做了什么?
What did you do?

35
00:03:32,691 --> 00:03:35,733
将军要让曼特城自生自灭?
The General is leaving Mantle to perish?

36
00:03:36,149 --> 00:03:37,483
他在拯救树不子
He's saving Remnant.

37
00:03:37,524 --> 00:03:39,483
我们不能让塞伦得到遗物
We can't let the Relics fall to Salem.

38
00:03:40,191 --> 00:03:43,816
但我们刚刚保护的那些人 他们活不下去的
But all those people we just protected,they won't survive.

39
00:03:43,858 --> 00:03:44,816
我们没有时间--
We don't have time to-

40
00:03:44,983 --> 00:03:46,358
你不会良心不安吗?
That doesn't bother you?

41
00:03:49,691 --> 00:03:52,691
你妹妹呢?我们的朋友呢?
What about your sister? Our friends?

42
00:03:52,941 --> 00:03:54,858
我的个人感情不重要
My personal feelings don't matter.

43
00:03:55,066 --> 00:03:56,316
我们有任务在身
We have orders.

44
00:03:56,483 --> 00:03:59,816
我要去取得冬之少女的能力 从而让我们能接触圣物
I'm to retrieve the power of the Winter Maiden so we can access the Relic

45
00:04:00,024 --> 00:04:01,733
你则要确保我的安全
You're here to ensure my safety.

46
00:04:03,066 --> 00:04:04,149
好了 走吧
Now come on.

47
00:04:04,316 --> 00:04:05,733
我们已经浪费了够多时间了
We've already lost enough time.

48
00:04:07,983 --> 00:04:09,441
你应该重视个人感情
It should matter.

49
00:04:13,358 --> 00:04:14,024
Penny
Penny.

50
00:04:14,566 --> 00:04:17,983
将军替我们做出了艰难的选择 我们就不用为难了
The General is making hard choices so we don't have to.

51
00:04:18,774 --> 00:04:21,858
这是为了所有人的利益 不只是部分人群
For the good of all, not just a few.

52
00:04:24,566 --> 00:04:28,191
我不觉得这对任何人有利
I do not see what is good about any of this.

53
00:04:30,483 --> 00:04:32,024
这一点我同意
On that we can agree.

54
00:04:34,149 --> 00:04:36,483
拜托了 想想你们在做什么
Please, think about what you're doing.

55
00:04:36,691 --> 00:04:37,858
你听到将军的话了
You heard the General.

56
00:04:38,024 --> 00:04:40,733
在事情解决前 你们要被拘留
Until this is sorted out, you're under arrest.

57
00:04:45,024 --> 00:04:45,691
认真的?
Really?

58
00:04:45,816 --> 00:04:47,858
请不要把这事变得更复杂
Please. Don't make this difficult.

59
00:04:47,941 --> 00:04:50,608
别让我们必须使用暴力才能离开
Don't make us have to get out of here by force.

60
00:04:52,858 --> 00:04:54,066
哇哇哇
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

61
00:04:54,191 --> 00:04:56,483
我们不会真的要打一架
We're not actually going to slug this out,

62
00:04:56,524 --> 00:04:57,066
对吧?
are we?

63
00:04:57,358 --> 00:04:59,066
我们什么都不做
We're not doing anything.

64
00:04:59,608 --> 00:05:01,399
他们来决定接下来的发展
They decide what happens next.

65
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:08,524
你觉得你们能阻止我们
You think you're going to stop us.

66
00:05:08,649 --> 00:05:11,358
我们是擎天最好的猎人
We're the best huntsmen in Atlas.

67
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:12,774
你们曾经是
You were.

68
00:05:12,941 --> 00:05:15,024
然后你们训练了我们
Then you trained us.

69
00:05:25,233 --> 00:05:26,233
拜托了哈里特!
Come on Harriet!

70
00:05:26,274 --> 00:05:28,233
我们这样正中了塞伦的下怀!
We're playing right into Salem's hands!

71
00:05:28,649 --> 00:05:31,024
你知道我们需要同心协力
You know we need to be working together.

72
00:05:31,066 --> 00:05:32,816
噢 可别给我来这一套!
Oh don't give me that crap!

73
00:05:33,066 --> 00:05:35,524
我从一开始就看透你们这帮孩子了
I had you kids pegged right from the start.

74
00:05:57,316 --> 00:05:58,399
嗯?
Huh?

75
00:05:58,441 --> 00:06:01,024
如果你能和平投降 我们不会伤害你
If you come peacefully, we won't hurt you.

76
00:06:01,066 --> 00:06:02,274
别替我们做主!
Speak for yourself!

77
00:06:02,316 --> 00:06:03,524
他们背叛了我们!
They betrayed us!

78
00:06:03,566 --> 00:06:06,566
你在背叛你宣誓保卫的人民!
You're betraying the people you've sworn to protect!

79
00:06:06,858 --> 00:06:08,066
别费口舌了Blake
It's not worth it Blake.

80
00:06:08,108 --> 00:06:10,066
他们只是在服从命令了
They're just following orders now.

81
00:06:25,399 --> 00:06:30,524
我知道你们雪倪家总是能为所欲为 但是时候打破这一惯例了
I know you Schnee's are used to getting what you want. But it's time to let this one go!

82
00:06:33,608 --> 00:06:35,524
这是我家乡
This is my home.

83
00:06:36,608 --> 00:06:38,816
而我是不会不战而降的
And I'm not giving it up without a fight.

84
00:06:58,608 --> 00:07:00,024
罗宾需要我们的帮助
Robyn needs help.

85
00:07:01,608 --> 00:07:04,649
投降 我们就能带她去擎天救治
Surrender and we can take her to Atlas, get her patched up.

86
00:07:06,066 --> 00:07:08,899
从没想过你那么会摆布人
Never pegged you for the manipulative type.

87
00:07:09,191 --> 00:07:11,441
但我今晚学到了很多
But I've learned a lot of things tonight.

88
00:07:11,649 --> 00:07:13,483
我很喜欢与你共事 你知道的
I enjoyed working with you, you know.

89
00:07:13,941 --> 00:07:16,649
哪怕是伴随你那无穷的玩世不恭
Even with that endless cynicism of yours.

90
00:07:17,149 --> 00:07:18,858
我经常被证明是对的
I'm usually proven right.

91
00:07:21,024 --> 00:07:23,108
我们不必战斗 朋友
We don't have to fight, friend.

92
00:07:23,691 --> 00:07:28,316
你对我朋友一无所知 这才是正常下场
You don't know my friends. That's how it always goes.

93
00:08:14,941 --> 00:08:17,358
噢 别因为我而停止
Oh don't stop on my account.

94
00:08:18,149 --> 00:08:19,816
我没这打算
Wasn't planning on it.

95
00:08:37,774 --> 00:08:40,566
你我还有账要算
Me and you have a score to settle.

96
00:08:40,608 --> 00:08:41,358
我同意
Oh I agree.

97
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:46,566
那么我们把那小子解决掉再来算账怎么样
So what's say we put the kid to bed and then finish it.

98
00:09:11,524 --> 00:09:13,358
马罗! 别废话了!
Marrow! Cut the crap will you!

99
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:15,774
我只想逮捕她 不是杀了她 哈里
I'm trying to arrest her, not kill her, Hare.

100
00:09:15,816 --> 00:09:17,649
你太过了!
You're being excessive!

101
00:09:17,691 --> 00:09:20,483
行之必须不为过
It's not excessive if it's necessary.

102
00:09:38,816 --> 00:09:43,608
该结束了 瓦因给过她们机会了 别手软
Time to wrap this up, Vine. They've had their chance. Don't be soft.

103
00:09:43,649 --> 00:09:45,316
你是在对我说?
Are you telling me?

104
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:47,358
还是对你自己?
Or yourself?

105
00:10:41,108 --> 00:10:42,066
待着!
Stay!

106
00:10:46,774 --> 00:10:48,066
待着!
Stay!

107
00:11:47,608 --> 00:11:49,316
我们必须阻止埃隆伍德
We have to stop Ironwood.

108
00:11:49,358 --> 00:11:51,691
如果他不能接触圣物 他就不能移动擎天
If he can't access the Relic, he can't move Atlas.

109
00:11:51,733 --> 00:11:53,691
我们得到冬之少女那里
We just have to get to the Winter Maiden.

110
00:11:53,816 --> 00:11:55,483
Blake和我去找其他人
Blake and I will look for the others.

111
00:11:55,524 --> 00:11:57,358
但我们的卷轴没法-
But our scrolls don't--

112
00:12:01,483 --> 00:12:02,899
噢!
Oh!

113
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,441
这就是她们找我们帮忙的时候了
This is the part where they ask us to help.

114
00:12:08,274 --> 00:12:10,233
奥斯卡一定在附近
Oscar must be around here.

115
00:12:10,483 --> 00:12:12,691
奥斯卡!
Oscar!

116
00:12:14,483 --> 00:12:16,358
奥斯卡!你在这!
Oscar! You're here!

117
00:12:17,524 --> 00:12:18,316
不!
No!

118
00:12:25,816 --> 00:12:28,274
这疯狂的女孩出现 并袭击我
This crazy girl showed up and attacked me.

119
00:12:28,858 --> 00:12:30,233
但她长得像其他人
But she looked like someone else.

120
00:12:30,483 --> 00:12:31,941
Neopolitan
Neopolitan.

121
00:12:31,983 --> 00:12:32,899
你认得她?
You know her?

122
00:12:33,066 --> 00:12:35,233
我们还没听到过好消息
We haven't exactly heard good things.

123
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:42,108
我希望她不会因此痛苦
I hope it will be painless for her.

124
00:12:42,899 --> 00:12:46,066
你说过你的个人情感不重要
You said your personal feelings do not matter.

125
00:12:46,816 --> 00:12:49,858
这不会改变我的行动 我所承诺要做的
They won't change my actions. What I'm committed to.

126
00:12:50,274 --> 00:12:54,066
冬之少女的力量和圣物务必不能落到敌人手里
The power of the Winter Maiden and the Relic must be kept from our enemies.

127
00:12:54,733 --> 00:12:56,358
哪怕这意味着她要死
Even if it means she dies.

128
00:12:58,649 --> 00:13:03,983
但没错Penny 我们必须承认自己的个人感情
But yes Penny, We must still acknowledge our personal feelings.

129
00:13:04,316 --> 00:13:06,066
应对它们
Wrestle with them.

130
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:08,399
这能保证我们走在正道
It ensures us that we're on the right path.

131
00:13:09,858 --> 00:13:11,774
让我们拥有人性
It's what makes us human.

132
00:13:13,233 --> 00:13:13,941
我觉得...
I think...

133
00:13:15,649 --> 00:13:17,024
我觉得我明白了
I think I understand.

134
00:13:18,649 --> 00:13:19,483
怎么回事
What was that?

135
00:13:42,066 --> 00:13:45,483
哦豁 埃隆伍德的宠物们
Hmm. Both of Ironwood's puppets.

136
00:13:45,899 --> 00:13:47,274
我真幸运
Lucky me.

137
00:13:47,316 --> 00:13:48,149
馨德
Cinder.

138
00:13:48,191 --> 00:13:52,108
你就是信标陨落和我遭遇事故的主谋
You were responsible for Beacon. For what happened to me

139
00:13:52,858 --> 00:13:56,566
然而只是暂时的
It was unfortunately temporary.

140
00:13:57,149 --> 00:14:00,691
现在滚一边去 免得这次再没残余躯体可以抢救了
Now step aside or there won't be anything left to salvage this time.

141
00:14:01,358 --> 00:14:03,566
考虑一下吧?
What do you think of that?

142
00:14:04,899 --> 00:14:06,233
我觉得...
I think...

143
00:14:10,066 --> 00:14:12,858
这让我有了个人感情
It gives me personal feelings.

144
00:15:04,316 --> 00:15:08,441
为什么你就不能做点正确的选择 而不是盲目听令
Why couldn't you just do the right thing instead of the thing you were told?

145
00:15:09,899 --> 00:15:12,441
有时正确的决定是最难做出的
Sometimes the right decision is the hardest to make.

146
00:15:12,858 --> 00:15:14,816
我用生命信任詹姆斯
I trust James with my life!

147
00:15:17,274 --> 00:15:18,691
我也想信任你
I wanted to trust you.

148
00:15:43,649 --> 00:15:46,483
看来你的朋友不行了
Doesn't look like your friend's going to make it.

149
00:15:46,983 --> 00:15:48,149
我要杀了你!
I'll kill you!

150
00:15:48,316 --> 00:15:51,941
你是说 就像你刚刚杀了克洛弗那样?
Oh you mean like you just killed Clover?

151
00:15:56,233 --> 00:15:59,274
啊 他们来了 时间刚刚好
Ah, here they come. Right on time.

152
00:16:05,483 --> 00:16:08,608
看来得等下再算账了
Looks like our score will have to wait.

153
00:16:08,983 --> 00:16:12,066
你知道我在当局的犯罪记录!
You know my track record with the authorities!

154
00:16:24,566 --> 00:16:26,274
总有人得为此付出代价
Someone had to take the fall.

155
00:16:28,524 --> 00:16:31,066
詹姆斯要为此付出代价
James will take the fall.

156
00:16:31,733 --> 00:16:33,191
我会确保这一点
I'll make sure of it.

157
00:16:42,108 --> 00:16:43,733
祝你好运
Good luck.